  m_Name: Notes from a scientist (part 2)
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  fullText: '"Day 3" ??? appears to be made of a metal composed of several known
    minerals. However, there are some unidentifiable components that gives further
    evidence to my theory. While we continue analyzing its structure, I have begun
    researching how it interacts when in contact with water, as the reports indicated
    that might be what caused it to "open".'
